# What the estate's own image is built from.
#
# The repository's root .dockerignore is written for a different image and
# excludes site/ and scripts/, which this one needs: the authored visual
# character every page is dressed in lives in site/matrix, and the standing
# automation lives in scripts.  BuildKit reads this file in preference to the
# root one when building this Dockerfile.
#
# Everything heavy and rebuildable stays out, so the context is megabytes
# rather than the two and a half gigabytes the working tree weighs.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.pyc
pgo-data/
pages-*/
architecture/atlas.index.json
*.archive
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# Built binaries: this image builds its own, for its own architecture.
cmd/*/bonfyre-*
components/*/bonfyre-*

# The vGPU's vendored runtime is not part of serving pages.
site/matrix/vgpu/node_modules

# The seed is the one large thing that must travel.
!deploy/fly/seed/estate.tar.gz
